(784, 1, '2025-11-30 04:55:39', '2025-11-30 04:55:39', '<!-- wp:my-e-shop/about-hero {\"title\":\"Trend-Led Identity Wear\",\"buttonText\":\"EXPLORE AND SHOP NOW\",\"backgroundImage\":{\"id\":743,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/9d204d738e01c2728a0f4926f997dedd920769e2.png\",\"alt\":\"\"}} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Style as self-expression</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We create affordable T-shirts with visual messages that reflect the inner world and mood of Generation Z and millennials. For us, clothing is not just a trend, but a language in which a person expresses themselves to the world.<br>Combining runway aesthetics with personal stories, we transform fashion ideas into meaningful pieces: where magic is transformation and creativity is a form of self-expression.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":755,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/e2c3b24adcb76d1dfe1175812aa64756bf6c1eb8-1024x634.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-755\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">How It All Began</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The brand\'s concept was born in 2024 from the feeling that between mass-market and luxury logos, there was little room for an identity—one that says, <strong>\"This is me, and this is my story.\"</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"I\'m Lana, and this brand is my creative response to fast fashion. I wanted clothes that are perceived as a message, not noise. Something thoughtful, aesthetically pleasing, and emotionally sincere.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We started where identity lives today:<br>in the inner world, digital space, cultural shifts, and personal symbols. Our process reflects the following:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>researching trends and emotional stories,</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>sketching ideas by hand,</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>refining them with AI as a creative collaborator,</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>printing each piece on demand.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our T-shirts are wearable stories—created for those who feel deeply and express their feelings openly.<br>Thus, our first four collections were born: Witch Core, Tender Thoughts, Identity in Action, and Data Muse — four different ways of saying: <strong>your style is your language, your art, your spell.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:my-e-shop/image-gallery {\"rows\":[{\"image1\":{\"id\":762,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/j3wba44sfrca5b6dewd8_2-1-1.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"id\":761,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/73it0g2jpyb246dgeq2r_2-1-1.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\"}},{\"image1\":{\"id\":760,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/k58gt7z392vfqyc7a529_2-1-1.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\"},\"image2\":{\"id\":759,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/a_high-fashion_editorial_backstage_photograph_featuring_four_young_models__two_women_and_two_men__s_fouq5xb7pz9lqvey81ex_10-1-1.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\"}}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:my-e-shop/faq {\"items\":[{\"id\":\"faq-1\",\"question\":\"Style as a Spell\",\"answer\":\"Our brand is not about trends chasing trends.\\u2028 It’s about building a space where people who think and feel deeply about aesthetics can connect — a community grounded in creativity, curiosity, and mutual respect. We celebrate individuality, but we grow through \"},{\"id\":\"faq-2\",\"question\":\"Creativity with Intent\",\"answer\":\"Our brand is not about trends chasing trends.\\u2028 It’s about building a space where people who think and feel deeply about aesthetics can connect — a community grounded in creativity, curiosity, and mutual respect. We celebrate individuality, but we grow through \"},{\"id\":\"faq-3\",\"question\":\"Identity-First Mindset\",\"answer\":\"Our brand is not about trends chasing trends.\\u2028 It’s about building a space where people who think and feel deeply about aesthetics can connect — a community grounded in creativity, curiosity, and mutual respect. We celebrate individuality, but we grow through \"},{\"id\":\"faq-4\",\"question\":\"Respect for Pace and Planet\",\"answer\":\"Our brand is not about trends chasing trends.\\u2028 It’s about building a space where people who think and feel deeply about aesthetics can connect — a community grounded in creativity, curiosity, and mutual respect. We celebrate individuality, but we grow through \"},{\"id\":\"faq-5\",\"question\":\"Community over Hype\",\"answer\":\"Our brand is not about trends chasing trends.\\u2028 It’s about building a space where people who think and feel deeply about aesthetics can connect — a community grounded in creativity, curiosity, and mutual respect. We celebrate individuality, but we grow through \"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":768,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/fashion_editorial_triptych_three_connected_scenes_showing_the_transformation_of_emotion_into_style-_l0w978embsiaj3qpovrq_3-3-1-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-768\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:my-e-shop/icon-cards {\"mainTitle\":\"Why Our T-Shirts Make Sense for You\",\"cards\":[{\"id\":\"card-1\",\"icon\":{\"id\":776,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Runway-Informed-Story-Driven-Prints.png\",\"alt\":\"\"},\"title\":\"Why Our T-Shirts Make Sense for You\",\"description\":\"Each design starts from original artwork — AI-assisted or hand-drawn — filtered through current runway trends and niche aesthetics. You get tees that feel editorial, not generic.\"},{\"id\":\"card-2\",\"icon\":{\"id\":775,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Premium-Look-Accessible-Price.png\",\"alt\":\"\"},\"title\":\"Premium Looks, Accessible Price\",\"description\":\"Soft cotton, clean fits and art-level graphics at a price that doesn’t mimic luxury markups. You pay for design and quality, not for a logo tax.\"},{\"id\":\"card-1764476883625\",\"icon\":{\"id\":774,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Focused-Themed-Drops.png\",\"alt\":\"\"},\"title\":\"Focused Themed Drops\",\"description\":\"We release small, tightly curated drops around clear worlds — witchy core, astrology, mental health, techwear, fashion activism. It’s easier to find “your vibe” without scrolling through hundreds of random designs.\"},{\"id\":\"card-1764476914803\",\"icon\":{\"id\":773,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Style-Guidance-Built-In.png\",\"alt\":\"\"},\"title\":\"Integrated style guide\",\"description\":\"Lookbooks, blog stories and outfit ideas help you see how each tee works in real wardrobes — from casual streetwear to “runway but make it every day”.\"},{\"id\":\"card-1764476939343\",\"icon\":{\"id\":772,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Made-to-Order-Production.png\",\"alt\":\"\"},\"title\":\"Made-to-Order Production\",\"description\":\"Your piece is printed when you order it. No dusty stock, less waste, and fresher prints — a modern alternative to overproduced fast fashion.\"},{\"id\":\"card-1764476939859\",\"icon\":{\"id\":771,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Human-Tech-Creativity.png\",\"alt\":\"\"},\"title\":\"Human + Tech Creativity\",\"description\":\"We combine intuition, hand-drawn textures and AI tools to explore visuals you won’t find in mass-market catalogs — keeping the brand both experimental and wearable.\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:my-e-shop/auto-slider {\"images\":[{\"id\":780,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Frame-1000004334-1.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\"},{\"id\":781,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Frame-1000004334-2.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\"},{\"id\":782,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Frame-1000004334-3.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\"},{\"id\":783,\"url\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Frame-1000004334-4.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\"}]} /-->', 'About Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-11-30 04:55:39', '2025-11-30 04:55:39', '', 2, 'https://cretho.com/?p=784', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
