\"iconImage\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Frame.png\",\"iconImageId\":0,\"iconType\":\"image\",\"isOpen\":true},{\"id\":2,\"question\":\"Meaningful quality in every detail\",\"answer\":\"Soft and breathable cotton, eco-friendly dyes that carefully crafted prints - because the quality of your clothes reflects your values.\",\"icon\":\"\",\"iconImage\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Frame1.png\",\"iconImageId\":0,\"iconType\":\"image\",\"isOpen\":true},{\"id\":3,\"question\":\"Uniqueness without overpaying\",\"answer\":\"Our collections are produced in small editions. Create your unique fashion story without the markup of luxury brands. Express yourself, be on trend and save your budget.\",\"icon\":\"\",\"iconImage\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Frame2.png\",\"iconImageId\":0,\"iconType\":\"image\",\"isOpen\":true}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[blog_trends title=\"Trends\" subtitle=\"Ride the wave of the future\" posts_count=\"2\"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:my-e-shop/newsletter-section {\"backgroundImage\":\"https://cretho.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/57993caaef790656d927198505123272066fe7d4-scaled.png\",\"backgroundImageId\":595,\"backgroundColor\":\"#ffffff\",\"overlay\":0} /-->', 'Main Page', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '517-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-12-05 05:14:02', '2025-12-05 05:14:02', '', 517, 'https://cretho.com/?p=796', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
